11:T43b,After 18 months of research and development, we launched products that have the potential to revolutionize the hair styling industry in India. Today, we are emerging as a brand that people look up to, compared to international brands, with pricing that is wallet-friendly and fits everyone's budget. Our entire concept revolves around providing the right products to our customers because they deserve the best. We aspire to build a community that appreciates the quality of our products. Currently, we offer a wide range of products, including hair styling, beard nourishing, and skin care products, and we hope to continue growing with the youth of India. Our goal is to provide the best quality products and become the "best partner" brand for men. Our aim is to instill confidence in men through our products. We understand that in the past, men were hesitant to use hair styling products daily due to harmful ingredients, but we have changed the game with our water-soluble and non-harmful products that can be used on a daily basis to achieve a well-groomed and confident look.1:["$","main",null,{"className":"our-story-page content-frame","id":"top","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"breadcrumbs","aria-label":"Breadcrumb","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/haxxed-grooming-concept/","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Our Story"}]]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"our-story-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"micro-label","children":"HAXXED Grooming Co."}],["$","h1",null,{"children":["Our Story",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"."}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"our-story-heading__stroke","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"our-story-opening","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"our-story-portrait","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/klsnvev_480x480.png?v=1730640830","alt":"HAXXED grooming style: a man with styled hair, sunglasses and a tailored suit","fetchPriority":"high"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"HAXXED / INDIA"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"EST. 2019"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"our-story-chapter our-story-chapter--intro","aria-labelledby":"story-chapter-1","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"our-story-chapter__number","aria-hidden":"true","children":"01"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"story-chapter-1","children":"The beginning"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"official-copy","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["HAXXED Grooming Co began as Dehawk Manssentials, a brand that manufactured homemade/handmade styling products in India. It all started in 2019 when there were limited options for high-quality hairstyling brands in the market that delivered the results as claimed. The other alternative was to choose international products, which were often beyond the budget of many. So, we decided to bring international quality products to India that were made with clean and natural ingredients and delivered outstanding results."]}]]}]]}]]}],[["$","section","0",{"className":"our-story-chapter our-story-chapter--row","aria-labelledby":"story-chapter-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"our-story-chapter__heading","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"our-story-chapter__number","aria-hidden":"true","children":"02"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"story-chapter-2","children":"Made. Tested. Refined."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"official-copy","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["Our journey began with developing ideas and sourcing raw materials to produce thousands of samples. Countless samples were made and tested by ourselves until we created a product that performed well in all climatic conditions in India and delivered maximum results. We aimed to create products that offered nourishing benefits and used high-quality ingredients for maximum styling benefits."]}]]}]]}],["$","section","1",{"className":"our-story-chapter our-story-chapter--row","aria-labelledby":"story-chapter-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"our-story-chapter__heading","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"our-story-chapter__number","aria-hidden":"true","children":"03"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"story-chapter-3","children":"Built around you."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"official-copy","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["$11"]}]]}]]}]],"$L12"]}]
